sional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m007-0247","start":247,"end":249,"surface":"豪桀","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、後裔或未定指代保留原文，不補成員姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m007-0265","start":265,"end":267,"surface":"武臣","kind":"person","person_id":"21i_ev7_c9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m007-0268","start":268,"end":271,"surface":"武信君","kind":"person","person_id":"21i_ev7_c9u","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p010","text":"至邯鄲，張耳、陳餘聞周章軍入關，至戲卻；又聞諸將爲陳王徇地，多以讒毀得罪誅，怨陳王不其筴不以爲將而以爲校尉。乃説武臣曰：「陳王起蘄，至陳而王，非必立六國後。將軍今以三千人下趙數十城，獨介居河北，不王無以塡之。且陳王聽讒，還報，恐不脱於禍。又不如立其兄弟；不，即立趙後。將軍毋失時，時閒不容息。」武臣乃聽之，遂立爲趙王。以陳餘爲大將軍，張耳爲右丞相，邵騷爲左丞相。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"周章","kind":"person","person_id":"52v_lww_ywo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"0wd_9iu_71i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"0wd_9iu_71i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"武臣","kind":"person","person_id":"21i_ev7_c9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"0wd_9iu_71i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m010-0105","sta