:"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m011-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"房君","kind":"person","person_id":"xlc_jrm_ei4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m011-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"武臣","kind":"person","person_id":"21i_ev7_c9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m011-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"0wd_9iu_71i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m011-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"武臣","kind":"person","person_id":"21i_ev7_c9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m011-0087","start":87,"end":91,"surface":"張耳子敖","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p012","text":"陳王使使者賀趙，令趣發兵西入關。張耳、陳餘説武臣曰：「王王趙，非楚意，特以計賀王。楚已滅秦，必加兵於趙。願王毋西兵，北徇燕、代，南收河内以自廣。趙南據大河，北有燕、代，楚雖勝秦，必不敢制趙。」趙王以爲然，因不西兵，而使韓廣略燕，李良略常山，張黡略上黨。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"0wd_9iu_71i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m012-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m012-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m012-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"武臣","kind":"person","person_id":"21i_ev7_c9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m012-0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"zbm_00e_awj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m012-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"21i_ev7_c9u","status":"con